---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MobilePublicShell from '../components/MobilePublicShell.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="TikTok Shop // neøflow Oficial TikTok Partners"
  description="Conheça a conexão oficial da neøflow para sellers autorizarem sua operação no TikTok Shop."
>
  <MobilePublicShell activeTab="shop" />
  <main class="shop-page">
    <div class="shop-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="shop-container">
      <!-- Breadcrumb / Back -->
      <a class="back-link font-mono" href="/">← TODAS AS ENTRADAS</a>

      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <header class="shop-hero">
        <div class="kicker-pill font-mono">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
          01 // SHOP // SELLERS
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display">Menos caminho entre atenção e venda.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Conectamos sua operação ao ecossistema TikTok Shop para aproximar produtos, conteúdo, creators e campanhas de onde a compra acontece.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <div class="hero-primary-wrap">
            <a class="btn-primary font-mono" href="/sellers/conectar">
              <span>CONECTAR MINHA LOJA</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
            <span class="cta-microcopy">Autorização feita pelo TikTok Shop.</span>
          </div>
          <a class="btn-secondary font-mono" href="/sellers">
            <span>EXPLORAR JORNADA SELLER</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- 4 Vantagens Aprovadas -->
      <section class="pillars-section" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
        <div class="section-badge font-mono">01 // VANTAGENS COMERCIAIS</div>
        <h2 id="pillars-title" class="font-display">Onde está a vantagem</h2>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <!-- Vantagem 1 -->
          <article class="pillar-card is-highlighted">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">01</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">DESCOBERTA E COMÉRCIO</span>
              <h3>VENDA ONDE A DESCOBERTA ACONTECE</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">
              O TikTok Shop aproxima conteúdo e comércio. Sua operação não precisa começar mandando o público para fora para só depois tentar converter.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Vantagem 2 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">02</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">DISTRIBUIÇÃO</span>
              <h3>CREATORS COMO DISTRIBUIÇÃO</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">
              Prepare produtos e oportunidades para trabalhar com creators que já fazem parte da dinâmica de descoberta da plataforma.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Vantagem 3 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">03</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">MÍDIA E OPERAÇÃO</span>
              <h3>CAMPANHAS MAIS PERTO DA OPERAÇÃO</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">
              Conteúdo, campanhas e Shop deixam de funcionar como ilhas separadas. A ideia é aproximar sinal, distribuição e resultado comercial.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Vantagem 4 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">04</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">EFICIÊNCIA</span>
              <h3>MENOS TRABALHO REPETITIVO</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">
              Integrações e automações existem para absorver tarefas operacionais por baixo, deixando você mais livre para decidir, criar e vender.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3 Caminhos de Aprofundamento Seller -->
      <section class="seller-explore-section" aria-labelledby="explore-title">
        <div class="section-badge font-mono">02 // APROFUNDAR OPERAÇÃO</div>
        <h2 id="explore-title" class="font-display">Três caminhos na jornada Seller</h2>

        <div class="explore-grid">
          <a class="explore-card" href="/sellers/creators">
            <div class="explore-header font-mono">
              <span>01 / CREATORS</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </div>
            <p>Coloque seus produtos em circulação por meio de conteúdo e colaboração.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="explore-card" href="/sellers/campanhas">
            <div class="explore-header font-mono">
              <span>02 / CAMPANHAS</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </div>
            <p>Estruture ações comerciais sem separar mídia da operação.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="explore-card is-conectar" href="/sellers/conectar">
            <div class="explore-header font-mono">
              <span>03 / CONECTAR</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </div>
            <p>Autorize sua Shop e dê o primeiro passo para integrar sua operação.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Integration CTA Section -->
      <section class="integration-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
        <div class="status-badge font-mono">
          <span class="status-live-dot"></span>
          PRIMEIRO PASSO DA OPERAÇÃO
        </div>
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="font-display">Pronto para conectar sua loja ao TikTok Shop?</h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">
          Inicie a autorização oficial com segurança e dê o primeiro passo para aproximar seus produtos de onde a compra acontece.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn-cta font-mono" href="/sellers/conectar">
            <span>CONECTAR MINHA LOJA</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <span class="security-stamp font-mono">
            Autorização feita pelo TikTok Shop · FLOWOFF MARKETING E ASSESSORIA DIGITAL LTDA
          </span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .shop-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: calc(7rem + var(--sat)) 1.25rem 5rem;
  }

  .shop-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10rem;
    right: -10rem;
    width: 48rem;
    height: 48rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.16) 0%, rgba(9, 19, 26, 0) 70%);
    filter: blur(40px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .shop-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4.5rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    transform: translateX(-3px);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .shop-hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .kicker-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3);
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--neo-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neo-coral);
  }

  .tagline {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .shop-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 840px;
  }

  .hero-lead strong {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
  }

  .hero-sublead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--neo-coral);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.45);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    color: var(--neo-white);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  /* Blueprint Showcase Section */
  .blueprint-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .blueprint-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .blueprint-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .blueprint-desc {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .image-showcase-wrapper {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .blueprint-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .blueprint-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(9, 19, 26, 0.85);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .hero-primary-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .cta-microcopy {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* Pillars Section */
  .pillars-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-badge {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .pillars-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    margin-top: -1.5rem;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .pillar-card.is-highlighted {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(38, 16, 23, 0.85) 0%, rgba(18, 20, 24, 0.92) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -4px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.18);
  }

  .pillar-card.is-highlighted:hover {
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.55);
  }

  .pillar-number {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .pillar-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .pillar-tag {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .pillar-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .pillar-summary {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* 3 Caminhos de Aprofundamento Seller */
  .seller-explore-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .seller-explore-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    margin-top: -1.25rem;
  }

  .explore-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .explore-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #ffffff;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .explore-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .explore-card.is-conectar {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(28, 14, 19, 0.75) 0%, rgba(14, 16, 19, 0.9) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3);
  }

  .explore-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .explore-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .pillar-details {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .pillar-details li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .pillar-details strong {
    color: var(--neo-white);
  }

  /* Payments Showcase */
  .payments-showcase-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .payments-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .payments-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .payments-lead {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .payments-points {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .payments-points li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .point-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    min-width: 90px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .payments-image-box {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    max-height: 520px;
  }

  .payments-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 520px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Manifesto Card */
  .manifesto-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.08) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.9) 80%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .manifesto-kicker {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .manifesto-quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .manifesto-highlight {
    color: var(--neo-white) !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .integration-cta {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    align-items: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .status-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #4ade80;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.25);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .status-live-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #4ade80;
  }

  .integration-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.85rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    max-width: 760px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .cta-desc {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 620px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-cta {
    background: var(--neo-coral);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.55);
  }

  .security-stamp {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 840px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .payments-showcase-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .payments-image-box {
      max-height: 400px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .shop-page {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .btn-cta {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
